          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1000,
          "content": "1  Splash: block wordmark centred, dot blinks teal/off for ~5 s while the file loads (two states on the right).",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ri6yp",
          "name": "2  Header: three-row",
          "fill": "#C2C2C2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1000,
          "content": "2  Header: the r. mark cut from the real logo, three rows in quarter-block cells, one row per context line (trace + files with the verdict pinned right, call + recorded, edgeport + dispatcher). The splash uses the same three-row mark, dot blinking.",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "BVtcW",
          "name": "3  Via notes sit two",
          "fill": "#C2C2C2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1000,
          "content": "3  Via notes sit two cells after the longest Via line behind a dim │, no longer at the far right edge.",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "X6auTv",
          "name": "4  Expanded hops: fu",
          "fill": "#C2C2C2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1000,
          "content": "4  Expanded hops: full component name, duration, action and +added −removed ~changed counts; one tier for the whole list, never cut mid-word.",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "DdtJZ",
          "name": "5  Time column: 6 ce",
          "fill": "#C2C2C2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1000,
          "content": "5  Time column: 6 cells, right-aligned, one cell from the left edge; the first rail starts right after it.",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "rfOgT",
          "name": "6  One blank row bet",
          "fill": "#C2C2C2",
